sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer (Next.js chat)
    participant C as AssistantController<br/>JWT user, rate limit
    participant A as BookingAgent<br/>ChatClient + memory
    participant G as Gemini API
    participant T as BookingAgentTools<br/>(bound to this user)
    participant S as BookingService / SlotBooker<br/>@Transactional
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: Turn 1: "Find the earliest mock coding interview this week and book it"
    U->>C: POST /api/assistant/chat
    C->>A: chat(user, conversationId, message)
    A->>G: system prompt + history + message + tool definitions
    G-->>A: call checkAvailability(fromDate, toDate, serviceId)
    A->>T: checkAvailability(...)
    T->>DB: SELECT open slots (via SlotService)
    T-->>A: slots, earliest first
    A->>G: tool result
    G-->>A: call proposeBooking(slotId)
    A->>T: proposeBooking(slotId)
    T->>T: store PendingAction(slot, turn 1). NOT booked
    A->>G: tool result "PENDING_CONFIRMATION"
    G-->>A: "Mock Coding Interview with Alice, Wed 10:00 AM. Confirm?"
    A-->>U: reply + pendingAction (Confirm / No buttons)

    Note over U,DB: Turn 2: "Yes"
    U->>C: POST /api/assistant/chat
    C->>A: chat(...)
    A->>G: history + "Yes"
    G-->>A: call confirmPendingAction()
    A->>T: confirmPendingAction()
    T->>T: proposed in turn 1 < turn 2, so allowed (atomic take)
    T->>S: book(user, slotId, serviceId)
    S->>DB: UPDATE slot ... WHERE version = ? AND status = 'OPEN'<br/>INSERT appointment + outbox row (one transaction)
    alt slot still open
        S-->>T: appointment
        T-->>A: DONE
        A->>G: tool result
        G-->>A: "Booked!"
        A-->>U: reply + actionsTaken
    else someone booked it first
        S-->>T: SlotUnavailableException (409 path)
        T-->>A: UNAVAILABLE + 3 alternatives
        A-->>U: "That slot was just taken. Alternatives: ..."
    end
